Until one is, no rights are granted: the default of copyright applies, and the
contents are readable here but not licensed for reuse or redistribution.

If you want to use something from this repository before that changes, ask —
the intent is to share, the licence simply has not been picked.

Note that this is about octalab's own contents. The upstream repositories in
refs/ are other people's work under their own licences: check each one before
copying anything out of it. And no Elektron firmware is here, under any licence
— see tools/check_no_firmware.py, which refuses to let one be committed.
